&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in data architecture, data engineering, or related roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Snowflake architecture and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in data modeling&amp;nbsp;(dimensional, normalized, and data vault)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL, Python, and data pipeline orchestration tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms&amp;nbsp;(AWS, Azure, or GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated industries&amp;nbsp;(medical devices, pharmaceuticals, or healthcare)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
