&lt;li&gt;Exposure to clinical, imaging, or diagnostic data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data cataloging and governance tools&amp;nbsp;(Collibra, Alation, Informatica)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snowflake certifications (SnowPro Core, SnowPro Advanced)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming data platforms&amp;nbsp;(Kafka, Event Hubs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural thinking and system design skills&lt;/li&gt;
