&lt;h2&gt;Job Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Entry-Level Desktop Support Technician (L1)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team and provide onsite technical support to end users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is an entry-level opportunity and is ideal for a &lt;strong&gt;recent graduate or candidate with up to 1 year of IT support experience&lt;/strong&gt;. The selected candidate will receive hands-on training and guidance to develop their desktop support and troubleshooting skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have a positive attitude, strong customer service skills, good communication skills, and a willingness to learn. They should be comfortable troubleshooting basic hardware and software issues and working directly with end users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide onsite Level 1 desktop and technical support to end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot basic hardware, operating system, software, and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure laptops, desktops, monitors, and other IT equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install and replace computer hardware components such as RAM and disk drives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, configure, and upgrade operating systems and software applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with Windows and macOS operating system deployment and imaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Microsoft Office 365 and other standard business applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot VPN, antivirus, authentication, and application-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform basic system health checks, software updates, patching, encryption, and security-related tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test equipment after repairs or configuration changes to ensure it is working properly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, update, and manage support tickets using IT service management/ticketing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Properly document troubleshooting steps, resolutions, and ticket updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize urgent technical issues and escalate them when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with IT asset management, equipment tracking, and inventory activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support video conferencing and basic infrastructure-related activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established IT support procedures, security standards, and company guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with onsite leadership and the global operations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel between local client sites when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
