&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of computer hardware and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Microsoft Windows and macOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic experience installing and troubleshooting software applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Microsoft Office 365.&lt;/li&gt;
