&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Join New Era Technology, where People First is at the heart of everything we do. With a global team of over 3,000 professionals, we&#39;re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels valued, empowered, and inspired to grow. Our mission is to securely connect people, places, and information with end-to-end technology solutions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At New Era, you&#39;ll join a team-oriented culture that prioritizes your personal and professional development. Work alongside industry-certified experts, access continuous training, and enjoy competitive benefits. Guided by our core attributes — putting people first, embracing continuous learning, and thriving through collaboration and inclusion — we nurture our people to deliver exceptional customer service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;If you want to make an impact in a supportive, growth-oriented environment, New Era is the place for you. Apply today and help us shape the future of work—together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Job Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Entry-Level Desktop Support Technician (L1)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team and provide onsite technical support to end users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;This is an entry-level opportunity and is ideal for a &lt;strong&gt;recent graduate or candidate with up to 1 year of IT support experience&lt;/strong&gt;. The selected candidate will receive hands-on training and guidance to develop their desktop support and troubleshooting skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have a positive attitude, strong customer service skills, good communication skills, and a willingness to learn. They should be comfortable troubleshooting basic hardware and software issues and working directly with end users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Provide onsite Level 1 desktop and technical support to end users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot basic hardware, operating system, software, and connectivity issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Set up and configure laptops, desktops, monitors, and other IT equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Install and replace computer hardware components such as RAM and disk drives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Install, configure, and upgrade operating systems and software applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Assist with Windows and macOS operating system deployment and imaging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Support Microsoft Office 365 and other standard business applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot VPN, antivirus, authentication, and application-related issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Perform basic system health checks, software updates, patching, encryption, and security-related tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Test equipment after repairs or configuration changes to ensure it is working properly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Create, update, and manage support tickets using IT service management/ticketing tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Properly document troubleshooting steps, resolutions, and ticket updates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Identify and prioritize urgent technical issues and escalate them when required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Assist with IT asset management, equipment tracking, and inventory activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Support video conferencing and basic infrastructure-related activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Follow established IT support procedures, security standards, and company guidelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Work closely with onsite leadership and the global operations team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Travel between local client sites when required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
