&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support security posture monitoring and remediation follow-up across all AWS accounts, contribute to GenAI-enabled application development, and participate in day-to-day cloud platform operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pillar 1 — GenAI Project Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and delivery of internal GenAI applications (e.g. AI-powered budget management tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture and design discussions for GenAI workloads on AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration of AWS AI/ML services (Bedrock, Lambda, API Gateway, S3) into application workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with AI-assisted development tools including VS Code, GitHub Copilot, Kiro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain technical documentation for GenAI features and components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pillar 2 — Cloud Security Operations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
