&lt;li&gt;Monitor security posture daily using Amazon Inspector, AWS Security Hub, AWS WAF, AWS Shield, and Amazon GuardDuty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, prioritize, and follow up on findings with respective application and infrastructure teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce and deliver security status reports to management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help enforce Security Hub controls and compliance baselines across all AWS accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pillar 3 — Cloud Platform BAU Run and Build&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support day-to-day operations across the AWS stack: RDS, ECS, EKS, EC2, S3, Lambda, API Gateway, CloudWatch, CloudFront, ELB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with networking operations including Direct Connect and Transit Gateway route table management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support CI/CD pipelines and deployments using GitHub Actions, ArgoCD, Helm and Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to observability and monitoring using CloudWatch, Grafana, Prometheus, and Dynatrace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in FinOps activities including cost visibility, tagging quality, daily cost reporting to management, and optimization follow-up with teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture reviews with a focus on secure, scalable, and cost-aware cloud design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain runbooks, technical documentation, and implementation notes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of hands-on AWS experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good AWS fundamentals: IAM, VPC, EC2, S3, Lambda, API Gateway, CloudWatch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cloud security tooling: Inspector, Security Hub, WAF, Shield, GuardDuty, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with FinOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with Linux CLI and basic system administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Configuration as Code (Terraform), CI/CD concepts; GitHub Actions experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills with the ability to follow up across teams and report to management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset and collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
