&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Field Service Technician to install, troubleshoot, repair, and maintain industrial cooling equipment at customer sites. If you enjoy working with electrical and mechanical equipment and solving technical problems, we&#39;d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, start up, and service cooling equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
