&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting industrial equipment, HVAC systems, manufacturing equipment, automation systems, compressors, pumps, generators, or similar machinery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read electrical schematics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on 200-440V electrical equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mechanical and electrical troubleshooting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable replacing electrical and mechanical components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
