&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Join New Era Technology, where People First is at the heart of everything we do. With a global team of over 3,000 professionals, we&#39;re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels valued, empowered, and inspired to grow. Our mission is to securely connect people, places, and information with end-to-end technology solutions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At New Era, you&#39;ll join a team-oriented culture that prioritizes your personal and professional development. Work alongside industry-certified experts, access continuous training, and enjoy competitive benefits. Guided by our core attributes — putting people first, embracing continuous learning, and thriving through collaboration and inclusion — we nurture our people to deliver exceptional customer service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;If you want to make an impact in a supportive, growth-oriented environment, New Era is the place for you. Apply today and help us shape the future of work—together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUMMARY:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Technician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to install, troubleshoot, repair, and maintain industrial cooling equipment at customer sites. If you enjoy working with electrical and mechanical equipment and solving technical problems, we&#39;d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install, start up, and service cooling equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot electrical and mechanical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace faulty parts such as motors, sensors, relays, switches, actuators, and other components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventive maintenance and inspections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read electrical wiring diagrams and basic technical drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test equipment and verify proper operation after repairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete service reports after each visit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide professional customer service while working onsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customer locations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;2 years of hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;repairing or maintaining electrical and mechanical equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting industrial equipment, HVAC systems, manufacturing equipment, automation systems, compressors, pumps, generators, or similar machinery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read electrical schematics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on &lt;strong&gt;200-440V electrical equipment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mechanical and electrical troubleshooting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable replacing electrical and mechanical components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with any of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HVAC equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electro-mechanical equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PLC-controlled equipment (basic knowledge is sufficient)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actuators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Servos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pumps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compressors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data center cooling systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A technical degree, trade school, military training, or vocational training is preferred &lt;strong&gt;but not required&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidates with strong hands-on experience are encouraged to apply even without a college degree.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lift up to 50 lbs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand, bend, kneel, and work at customer locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 20% as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically, Monday-Friday, 8-hour shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional overtime and on-call support may be required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
