&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUMMARY: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Material Specialist assures that inventory, tools and supplies, both customer and New Era Technology owned, are accurately received, picked, packed and shipped while monitoring and maintaining various project shipping schedules and executing inventory control practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRIMARY DUTIES include but not limited to:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of staging, receiving, packing, shipping and tracking packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain various project shipping schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive and distribute packages accurately to New Era Technology personnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unpack and check inventory received against purchase orders or invoices assuring correct quality and quantities were delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Print out material request forms.&amp;nbsp; Print purchase orders to generate receiving slip and sales orders to generate packing slip and ship orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship orders to destination to arrive intact and prior to scheduled installation time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Record inventory transactions such as receiving, shipping, and location transfers allowing for accurate and timely receiving, shipping, and inventory reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inventory by performing cycle counts, maintaining current part numbers and locations, and working with Inventory Controller to determine inventory discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform inventory replenishments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean and inspect a variety of used equipment and peripherals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Inventory Controller with all inventory activities as directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep warehouse cleaned and organized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance of essential duties satisfactorily dependably and reliably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and retain customer confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties and responsibilities as assigned&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPETENCIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to proactively troubleshoot to prevent issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively problem solve when issues arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand new information by studying and working with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt and evolve quickly and professionally in an ever-changing workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively communicate, present information, and respond to managers, employees, customers, and vendors in an intelligent, clear, concise, professional and grammatically correct manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build collaborative relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent and confident decision-making skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Microsoft Word, Excel, Outlook and the Internet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to work overtime as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED EDUCATION &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE REQUIRED: &amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
