&lt;h1&gt;Project Manager – PMaaS (Audio Visual / Workplace Technology Projects)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Mumbai (Work from Client Location)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time / Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company:&lt;/strong&gt; New Era Technology&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Era Technology is looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Project Manager (PMaaS)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the successful delivery of enterprise Audio Visual (AV), Workplace Technology, and Smart Office infrastructure projects for one of our global clients based in Bangalore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be responsible for managing projects end-to-end—from requirements gathering and budgeting through design coordination, vendor management, implementation, testing, and project closeout. This role requires strong stakeholder management, project governance, budget control, and experience coordinating cross-functional teams in enterprise workplace technology environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Project Planning &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage multiple AV and workplace technology projects simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gather business and technical requirements from stakeholders and client teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct project kick-off meetings and define project scope, timelines, milestones, and deliverables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare project estimates, budgets, resource plans, and Statements of Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain project documentation, trackers, and status reports throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Financial Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop project budgets and high-level cost estimates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support business case preparation and financial approvals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor project costs, forecasts, purchase orders, and change requests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure projects remain within approved budgets while maintaining delivery quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Design &amp;amp; Solution Coordination&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review floor plans, layouts, and room designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with engineering and design teams to develop AV solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review Bills of Materials (BOMs), equipment specifications, and technical designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in solution reviews for custom and complex workplace technology deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Procurement Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with AV integration partners and technology vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare Request for Proposal (RFP) documentation when required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in vendor evaluations, bid reviews, and commercial discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage vendor deliverables, schedules, quality, and project execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Project Execution&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop detailed implementation schedules with key milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate project activities across multiple internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track risks, issues, dependencies, and mitigation plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct regular project review meetings and provide executive status updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform site inspections to ensure quality standards and project compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technology Deployment&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate deployment of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise Audio Visual systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Meeting Room Technologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Signage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
