&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Network-enabled AV Devices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate asset inventory, IP allocation, documentation, and configuration activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure deployment aligns with enterprise technology standards and governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Project Governance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain project documentation and SharePoint repositories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update project management tools and dashboards regularly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
