&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead project handover to Operations teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure completion of documentation, asset records, invoices, and final project deliverables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct project closeout activities and obtain stakeholder sign-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Archive project documentation and update project status to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
