&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Project Coordinator provides administrative, procurement, vendor management, and project coordination support for Workplace Technology projects across the APAC region. This role works closely with Project Managers, Finance, Procurement, Technology teams, and external vendors to support successful project delivery while ensuring compliance with internal governance and approval processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-month contract position with potential opportunity to renew annually.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following include but may not be limited to the responsibilities of the Service Coordinator:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate project activities, schedules, meetings, and action items to support project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and maintain project documentation, reports, trackers, and status updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage procurement activities, including vendor quotations, purchase requisitions (PRs), purchase orders (POs), and approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with vendors to coordinate pricing, deliveries, installations, and project timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project milestones and proactively follow up on outstanding actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support invoice validation and payment tracking to ensure procurement records remain accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized project, procurement, and financial documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide administrative and operational support to Project Managers and the wider project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Set-up / Work Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client’s Site (Changi)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monday – Friday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
