&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Hiring: Project Manager (Client Location) | New Era Technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Location: Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia&lt;br&gt;Company: New Era Technology – &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.neweratech.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;www.neweratech.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Work Type: Full-Time (Onsite)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment: Permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Era Technology is looking for experienced Project Manager to be deployed at our prestigious client in Malaysia at their Kuala Lumpur Office.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Scope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage tactical and transformation projects and technology implementation throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, document, analyze, challenge internal &amp;amp; external customer requirements (if required), to ensure the project meets business needs / strategic aims.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake detailed project planning &amp;amp; documentation (defining project deliverables, success criteria, benefits management, dependencies, change control, risk management) including escalating risks and issues as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliant with project governance and standards as stipulated in the PMO Governance Framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate the roles and responsibilities defined in the project organization structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolution of issues and mitigation of risks without compromising the timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and validate the project scope, objectives, deliverables, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a detailed project plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and secure the required resources, budget, and project team structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and manage project risks, assumptions, dependencies, and mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish project governance, reporting cadence, and escalation mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a stakeholder engagement and communication plan to ensure alignment and commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct the project kick-off to prepare for execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop work breakdown structure (WBS) for resource allocation and identify dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and communicate roles and responsibilities of project team (including vendor) to ensure alignment in terms of expectation and accountabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain work schedules, define milestones and critical path for timely completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain regular meetings/cadence for progress reviews, SDLC tollgate reviews, and prioritization/escalation discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands the scope and requirements of the project and ensures the implementation is compliant to company processes and BNM/RMIT regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands technical issues and escalate issues as needed and drive them to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively use metrics to track progress, identify issues, make decisions and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively anticipate project risks and issues to identify resources, corrective actions or leadership escalations needed to maintain project timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage change using appropriate verification techniques to assess impact, evaluate options, estimate cost, and present justification for approval by Project Sponsor / PSC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate project interdependencies and propose mitigation for associated risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhered to project governance and following the established project management methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform project closure with proper handover and acceptance by the stakeholders and submit files for PMO project repository.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formalized support model for project closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform post implementation review and share lessons learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change and Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chair project status meeting to drive outcomes, or lead problem solving meetings to reach conclusions and agreement on resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform risk management to mitigate all identified risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee project communication and clarify communication gap by delivering message / guidance / directions timely, driving decisions, and updating stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage expectation of Project Sponsor throughout the project lifecycle, which includes to obtain buy-in from Key Stakeholders / Senior Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PMO / Project Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt project governance standards and ensure desired outcomes and its original intent is met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formalize project organization structure, roles and responsibilities, person-in-charge, and key deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Result Area&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project baseline accepted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment on Project plan and scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed project plan and clear milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment on scope, budget, schedule, team, risk / issue, communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project closure with support model accepted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project deliverables documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formalized support model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share lessons learned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholders buy-in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliant to PMO Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification and Experience Requirement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EDUCATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree / Professional Degree in Computer Science/Information Technology or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certification in project management is preferred, but certified PMP and/or certified Scrum Master is added advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WORK EXPERIENCE&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience in managing IT projects and system implementation / enhancement, with at least 3 full lifecycle of system implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical project management skills, preferably with experience in managing transformation projects related to Core Insurance system (AS400), insurance products launch, Insurance Point-of-Sales systems (POS), Agent/Customer/Claim Portal, Corporate Websites and Data Lake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Priority will be given to candidates with experience or domain expertise in GI/Life insurance products, Digital, big data, analytics, AI, infra and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing at least 5 full-time team members, excluding the implementation vendor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Bank Negara Malaysia’s Risk Management in Technology (RMiT) guidelines, ensuring compliance and effective risk controls in technology initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in driving and managing RFP/RFQ end to end process will be added advantage.&amp;nbsp; E.g. to work closely with cross-functional team to prepare RFP/RFQ pack, evaluating vendor proposals and overseeing the selection process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop comprehensive business cases, including cost-benefit analysis, risk assessment, and strategic alignment with organizational objectives will be an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge in project management methodologies, such as Waterfall, Agile, and Kanban.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advisory skills including ability to analyse, trouble-shoot, support, challenge and advise other project and program managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpersonal skills and relationship management, including ability to engage, communicate with, influence and negotiate with senior management and stakeholders Team management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills, i.e. verbal, written and in presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good interpersonal and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project financial cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Preferred Candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nationality:&lt;/strong&gt; Malaysians or Malaysian PR preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability:&lt;/strong&gt; Candidates who can join immediate to 30days notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
