&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior .NET Full Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, develop, and support scalable enterprise applications using modern Microsoft technologies. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;C#, .NET Core/.NET 6+, Angular, Microservices, REST APIs, Cloud Platforms (Azure/AWS), and DevOps practices&lt;/strong&gt;. This role will be responsible for building secure, high-performance applications while collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver innovative business solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, test, and maintain enterprise web applications using &lt;strong&gt;C#, ASP.NET Core, .NET Framework, and .NET 6+&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and enhance responsive user interfaces using &lt;strong&gt;Angular (v10+)&lt;/strong&gt;, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, and Kendo UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Single Page Applications (SPAs) utilizing modern Angular architecture and component-based design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable services, components, and libraries to improve application maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API &amp;amp; Backend Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop &lt;strong&gt;RESTful APIs&lt;/strong&gt;, Web Services, and Microservices architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable backend services using &lt;strong&gt;ASP.NET Core Web API&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and integrate &lt;strong&gt;GraphQL APIs&lt;/strong&gt; where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement authentication and authorization using &lt;strong&gt;OAuth 2.0&lt;/strong&gt;, OpenID Connect, and role-based access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate applications with third-party services and enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and manage applications within &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Azure&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines using &lt;strong&gt;Azure DevOps, Git, TFS, or AWS DevOps tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize cloud-native services such as:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Data Factory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Blob Storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Resource Manager (ARM) Templates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor application performance and optimize cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize database solutions using:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL Server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MongoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop stored procedures, views, and performance-tuned queries using &lt;strong&gt;T-SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;PL/SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize &lt;strong&gt;Entity Framework Core&lt;/strong&gt; for ORM and data access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Messaging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop event-driven solutions using &lt;strong&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support distributed systems and real-time data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement system integrations leveraging microservices and messaging frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
