&lt;p&gt;• Strong organizational and multitasking skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Excellent communication and customer service skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
