&lt;h1&gt;FCC Business Analyst (B2C) – Production Operations &amp;amp; Support&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 7-12 Years&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bangalore / Chennai / Pune / Gurugram / Mumbai (Work from Office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; 6-Month Contract-to-Hire (Conversion to Full-Time based on performance)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift:&lt;/strong&gt; General Shift&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;SFCC Business Analyst (B2C)&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC) Production Support&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;IBM Sterling OMS&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Order Management Systems (OMS)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be responsible for supporting business-critical eCommerce production environments, managing order lifecycle issues, resolving production incidents, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless business operations. This role requires excellent analytical skills, stakeholder management, and the ability to drive issue resolution in a fast-paced production support environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide end-to-end production support for Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC) applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and manage day-to-day eCommerce production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze, troubleshoot, and resolve complex production issues related to SFCC, OMS, payment gateways, shipping, and third-party integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor order lifecycle, order flow, and fulfillment processes to identify operational exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for production incidents and business-critical escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Root Cause Analysis (RCA) and recommend preventive measures for recurring issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Business, Product, Engineering, Operations, Client, and Vendor teams to ensure timely issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage stakeholder communication by providing regular updates and resolution timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Major Incident Management activities and coordinate cross-functional teams during production outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation for incidents, RCA reports, SOPs, and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Functional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC) Production Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience supporting &lt;strong&gt;B2C Commerce&lt;/strong&gt; applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Order Management Systems (OMS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;IBM Sterling OMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Order Lifecycle Management and Order Processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Order Orchestration and Fulfillment processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident Management and Production Operations experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder and client communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SFCC Production Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IBM Sterling OMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order Management System (OMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order Lifecycle Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order Flow Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SOAP APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Major Incident Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Log Analysis &amp;amp; Monitoring Tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;SFCC Storefront Reference Architecture (SFRA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Commerce Cloud Business Manager (BM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inventory Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payment Gateway Integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping Integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retail Commerce / eCommerce domain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Agile teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7-12 years of experience as a Business Analyst or Production Support Analyst in eCommerce environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience supporting SFCC-based B2C applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with IBM Sterling OMS and Order Management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage production-critical issues under tight timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with leading global retail and eCommerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Salesforce Commerce Cloud implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and fast-paced work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong opportunity for full-time conversion after the initial contract period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
