&lt;li&gt;Maintain detailed documentation of network designs, migration procedures, and configuration standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring issues and drive long‑term improvements to deployment processes and network architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to playbooks, runbooks, and knowledge‑sharing materials for engineering and field teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPETENCIES: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
