&lt;li&gt;Industry certifications such as Fortinet NSE, Juniper JNCIS/JNCIP, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large‑scale network refresh or transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with automation tools (Python, Ansible) for configuration and operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SD‑WAN, Zero Trust, or cloud‑integrated network architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder‑management abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead under pressure and make sound technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative mindset with a focus on mentoring and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED EDUCATION &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE REQUIRED: &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive hands‑on experience with Fortinet firewalls (FortiGate, FortiManager, FortiAnalyzer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise with Juniper switches and Juniper wireless solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
