&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Execute campaign targeting across multiple marketing channels. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Collect, analyze, and validate data from internal and external data platforms in support of targeting marketing communications. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Facilitate and execute development of targeting insights to inform data driven decisions and improve performance objective of channel partners. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Utilize data to inform key business communication objectives and assess feasibility of executing targeting. Draw insights, document findings, and communicate results from targeted marketing communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work in a highly collaborative environment with Digital Communications, Lifecycle, and eCommerce Marketing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support the business in decision-making processes by providing forward-looking analysis and insight to cross-functional partners ensuring alignment of campaign plans and targeting strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Execute ad hoc analyses and assist with special projects as directed by supervisor. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Must be able to perform the essential functions of this position with or without reasonable accommodation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
