&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 1 year of experience in data analysis, marketing campaign measurement and/or targeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with different data measurement and execution platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
